===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|spiegel}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|spiegal}} or {{m|goh|spēgal}}, from {{etyl|ML.|de}} {{m|la|speglum}}, from {{etyl|la|de}} {{m|la|speculum}}.
Cognate with Dutch {{m|nl|spiegel}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=Spiegel}}</ref>

